## What's Included:

**CSS Variables** - All 28 Catppuccin Mocha colors are now available as CSS custom properties:
- **14 Accent colors** (rosewater, flamingo, pink, mauve, red, maroon, peach, yellow, green, teal, sky, sapphire, blue, lavender)
- **14 Neutral colors** (text, subtext levels, overlays, surfaces, base, mantle, crust)

**Applied Styling**:
- `background-color: var(--ctp-base)` - Dark background (#1e1e2e)
- `color: var(--ctp-text)` - Light text (#cdd6f4)
- Added a default font stack

## How to Use These Colors:

Now you can use Catppuccin colors anywhere in your components:

```css
/* In any .astro component's <style> block */
.button {
	background-color: var(--ctp-blue);
	color: var(--ctp-crust);
}

.link {
	color: var(--ctp-sapphire);
}

.card {
	background-color: var(--ctp-surface0);
	border: 1px solid var(--ctp-surface1);
}
```

The colors are defined at the `:root` level, so they're available globally throughout your entire project!
